algorithms.pseudocode:
Input: P in R^{c x d}, x in R^d, y in {0,...,c-1}
Output: margin = min_{j != y} (score(x,j) - score(x,y))

scores = [TropicalScore(P[k], x) for k in 0..c-1]
margin = +inf
for j = 0 to c-1:
    if j != y:
        margin = min(margin, scores[j] - scores[y])
return margin

Complexity: O(cd) time, O(c) space
